{"text": "This is the story of the great war that Rikki tikki tavi fought all by himself. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was a mongoose, a small animal that looked a little like a cat. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One summer, a big flood washed him out of the hole where he lived with his family. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He held on to a piece of floating grass until he lost his senses. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When he woke up, he was lying on a garden path in the hot sun. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A small boy named Teddy found him and said, Here is a dead mongoose, Let us have a funeral. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> No, said his mother, let us take him in and dry him. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They wrapped him in warm cotton, and soon he opened his eyes and sneezed. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Every mongoose family has a motto, which is Run and find out. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Rikki ran all around the table and jumped up onto Teddys shoulder. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Do not be afraid, Teddy, said his father, That is how he makes friends. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That night he slept on Teddys pillow, close to the boy.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "i", "s", " ", "i", "s", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "s", "t", "o", "r", "y", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "g", "r", "e", "a", "t", " ", "w", "a", "r", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "R", "i", "k", "k", "i", " ", "t", "i", "k", "k", "i", " ", "t", "a", "v", "i", " ", "f", "o", "u", "g", "h", "t", " ", "a", "l", "l", " ", "b", "y", " ", "h", "i", "m", "s", "e", "l", "f", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "m", "o", "n", "g", "o", "o", "s", "e", ",", " ", "a", " ", "s", "m", "a", "l", "l", " ", "a", "n", "i", "m", "a", "l", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "l", "o", "o", "k", "e", "d", " ", "a", " ", "l", "i", "t", "t", "l", "e", " ", "l", "i", "k", "e", " ", "a", " ", "c", "a", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r"